{"q":"3","t":"Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given a string <code>s</code>, find the length of the <strong>longest</strong> <span data-keyword=\"substring-nonempty\"><strong>substring</strong></span> without duplicate characters.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> s = &quot;abcabcbb&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> 3\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> The answer is &quot;abc&quot;, with the length of 3. Note that <code>&quot;bca&quot;</code> and <code>&quot;cab&quot;</code> are also correct answers.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> s = &quot;bbbbb&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> 1\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> The answer is &quot;b&quot;, with the length of 1.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> s = &quot;pwwkew&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> 3\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> The answer is &quot;wke&quot;, with the length of 3.\nNotice that the answer must be a substring, &quot;pwke&quot; is a subsequence and not a substring.\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>s</code> consists of English letters, digits, symbols and spaces.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":["There are less than 100 unique characters. We can check all substrings with length at most 100 for example. This is a good enough approximation."],"m":"{ \r\n  \"name\": \"lengthOfLongestSubstring\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    { \r\n      \"name\": \"s\",\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Hash Table","slug":"hash-table"},{"name":"String","slug":"string"},{"name":"Sliding Window","slug":"sliding-window"}],"s":[{"t":"Longest Substring with At Most Two Distinct Characters","s":"longest-substring-with-at-most-two-distinct-characters","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Longest Substring with At Most K Distinct Characters","s":"longest-substring-with-at-most-k-distinct-characters","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Subarrays with K Different Integers","s":"subarrays-with-k-different-integers","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Maximum Erasure Value","s":"maximum-erasure-value","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Number of Equal Count Substrings","s":"number-of-equal-count-substrings","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Minimum Consecutive Cards to Pick Up","s":"minimum-consecutive-cards-to-pick-up","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Longest Nice Subarray","s":"longest-nice-subarray","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Optimal Partition of String","s":"optimal-partition-of-string","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Count Complete Subarrays in an Array","s":"count-complete-subarrays-in-an-array","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Find Longest Special Substring That Occurs Thrice II","s":"find-longest-special-substring-that-occurs-thrice-ii","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Find Longest Special Substring That Occurs Thrice I","s":"find-longest-special-substring-that-occurs-thrice-i","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Meta","facebook"],["Infosys","infosys"],["Spotify","spotify"],["Apple","apple"],["Yandex","yandex"],["tcs","tcs"],["Cognizant","cognizant"],["Deloitte","deloitte"],["Visa","visa"],["Agoda","agoda"],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs"],["LinkedIn","linkedin"],["Netflix","netflix"],["Zoho","zoho"],["Nvidia","nvidia"],["Accolite","accolite"],["Wipro","wipro"],["IBM","ibm"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Walmart Labs","walmart-labs"],["Salesforce","salesforce"],["AT&T","att"],["HashedIn","hashedin"],["PayPal","paypal"],["Cisco","cisco"],["Qualcomm","qualcomm"],["Docusign","docusign"],["Morgan Stanley","morgan-stanley"],["JPMorgan Chase","jpmorgan"],["athenahealth","athenahealth"],["Airtel","airtel"],["EPAM